So if you have this in your server function (and assuming that sweepnetSamples is a data frame):

output$sampleList <- reactive({
  nrow(sweepnetSamples())
})

You can have something like the following in the UI function:

column(10,
  conditionalPanel("output.sampleList >= 1",
    dataTableUI("one")
  ),
  conditionalPanel("output.sampleList >= 2",
    dataTableUI("two")
  ),
  conditionalPanel("output.sampleList >= 3",

    dataTableUI("three")
  )
)

